  "description": "Autograder workflow panels (runs, queue latency, workflow_run_error counts) are DB-backed and are refreshed only by a web pod running with METRICS_WORKFLOW_REFRESH_LEADER set (web.workflowMetricsLeader, which requires web.replicas=1). Without a leader anywhere in the deploy these panels are instrumented, scraped, and permanently empty \u2014 which reads as 'no workflow activity' rather than 'not being collected'."
